'''''The Fishermen and the City''''' ({{Korean|hangul=나만 믿고 따라와, 도시어부}}), also known as '''''City Fisherman''''', is a South Korea [[variety show]] program on [[Channel A (TV channel)|Channel A]]. Currently, the show consist of [[Lee Deok-hwa]], [[Lee Kyung-kyu]], [[Lee Soo-geun]], [[Lee Tae-gon]] and [[Kim Jun-hyun (comedian)|Kim Jun-hyun]].<ref name="S3 detail" />

The filming began in July 2017.<ref>{{cite news|url=http://sports.donga.com/3/all/20170724/85502084/1|script-title=ko:채널A 신규예능 '도시어부' 이경규-이덕화, 화려한 라인업 28일 첫 녹화|trans-title=Channel A's new variety show 'The Fishermen and the City', with a line-up including Lee Kyung-kyu and Lee Deok-hwa, to begin recording on 28th|newspaper=[[The Dong-A Ilbo]]|date=2017-07-24|access-date=2018-08-31}}</ref> Season 1 of the show was aired on [[Channel A (TV channel)|Channel A]] starting September 7, 2017 and ended on September 9, 2019. It was distributed and syndicated by [[Channel A (TV channel)|Channel A]] every Thursday at 23:00 ([[Time in South Korea|KST]]).<ref>{{Cite news|url=https://sg.style.yahoo.com/city-fisherman-abrupt-kyung-kyu-and-his-serious-022010774.html|title='City Fisherman' Abrupt Kyung Kyu and his Serious Composed Fishing…|access-date=2018-08-31|language=en-SG}}</ref>

Season 2 of show started on December 19, 2019, and ended on February 4, 2021. It was aired on [[Channel A (TV channel)|Channel A]] every Thursday at 21.00 ([[Time in South Korea|KST]]).<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.tvreport.co.kr/2023283|script-title=ko:'도시어부2-대항해시대' 이경규부터 박병은까지..포스터 공개|website=TV리포트|access-date=2019-12-25}}</ref>

The end of Season 2 will make way for the planning of Season 3.<ref>{{Cite web|last=tf.co.kr|date=2021-01-29|script-title=ko:'도시어부2' 2월4일 종영, 차기작 준비 휴식기 돌입|url=http://news.tf.co.kr/read/entertain/1840337.htm|access-date=2021-02-07|website=더팩트|language=ko}}</ref> Season 3 of show started on May 6, 2021<ref name="S3 detail">{{Cite web|date=2021-05-04|script-title=ko:'도시어부3' 이덕화·이경규·이수근·이태곤·김준현, 시즌3 승선 확정|url=https://www.news1.kr/articles/4296150|access-date=2021-06-17|website=[[News1 (South Korean company)|News1]]|language=ko}}</ref> and ended on January 27, 2022. It was aired on [[Channel A (TV channel)|Channel A]] every Thursday at 22.30 ([[Time in South Korea|KST]]).<ref name="S3 detail" />

On May 17, 2022, Channel A had announced the show will be renewing for a Season 4 that is slated to air in July 2022.<ref>{{Cite web |date=2022-05-17 |script-title=ko:7월에 돌아오는 '도시어부4'…이경규x이덕화 확정 [공식] |url=https://www.news1.kr/articles/4683134 |access-date=2022-05-22 |website=[[News1 (South Korean company)|News1]] |language=ko}}</ref>

==Synopsis==
This is a fishing entertainment program featuring the 2 MCs of the show ''([[Lee Deok-hwa]] and [[Lee Kyung-kyu]])''. On every episode, they also give celebrities who enjoy fishing the opportunity to visit beautiful, secret fishing spots and having bonding time. While on the show, celebrities also share useful fishing tips with viewers.<ref>{{Cite news|url=http://english.donga.com/List/3/08/26/1205894/1|title=Channel A's 'The Fishermen and the City' received top ratings|work=english.donga.com|access-date=2018-09-18|language=en}}</ref><ref>{{Cite news|url=http://english.donga.com/Home/3/all/26/1293360/1|title=TV show 'City Fisherman' receives highest ratings|work=english.donga.com|access-date=2018-09-18|language=en}}</ref><ref>{{Cite news|url=http://www.xportsnews.com/jenter/?ac=article_view&entry_id=998940|script-title=ko:[공식입장] 장혁, '도시어부' 알래스카편 게스트 출연 확정|date=2018-07-19|access-date=2018-09-18|language=ko}}</ref>

